      "description": "AWTRIX NG is the companion app for pixel clocks running the AWTRIX NG firmware, such as the Ulanzi TC001, the Ulanzi TC002 and other ESP32 LED displays.\n\nFIND YOUR CLOCKS\nThe app finds AWTRIX NG clocks in your Wi-Fi. You can also add a clock by its address.\n\nSEE AND CONTROL\n- See what your clock shows, live.\n- Open the clock's full web interface.\n- Start and stop scripts and games.\n\nAWTRIX HUB BUILT IN\nBrowse scripts and icons made by the community. The Hub shows only what runs on your clock and installs it with one tap.\n\nPLAY WITH YOUR PHONE\nTurn your phone into a gamepad for games on the clock. Two phones can play together.\n\nTALK TO YOUR CLOCK\nRecord a short voice message and play it on clocks with a speaker.\n\nSHARE TO YOUR CLOCK\nSend text and pictures from other apps to your clock, or save a picture as an icon.\n\nIPHONE NOTIFICATIONS ON THE TC002\nThe Ulanzi TC002 connects to your iPhone over Bluetooth. It shows your notifications and the music that is playing. You choose which apps appear.\n\nPRIVATE BY DESIGN\nThe app talks to your clocks directly in your home network. No ads, no tracking, no analytics.\n\nRequires a clock running the AWTRIX NG firmware.",
